@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@accessToken = replace-with-login-token
@organizationId = replace-with-organization-id
@propertyId = replace-with-property-id
@listingId = replace-with-listing-id
@videoId = replace-with-video-id
@videoPath = C:/path/to/your/clip.mp4
@videoVersion = 0
@listingVersion = 0
@propertyVersion = 1
@unitVersion = 0

### Upload an existing local MP4/MOV privately; replace videoPath above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=VideoUploadBoundary

--VideoUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="clip.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< {{videoPath}}
--VideoUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

Property walkthrough
--VideoUploadBoundary--

### Read video metadata/current versions; default excludes archived videos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/videos?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### View private video bytes as a member of the owning or delegated organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/videos/{{videoId}}/content
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update its caption; published uses of the old version become hidden
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/videos/{{videoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{videoVersion}},"caption":"Updated walkthrough caption"}

### Select approved videos when publishing; always use current source and video versions
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/listings/{{listingId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{listingVersion}},"propertyVersion":{{propertyVersion}},"unitVersion":{{unitVersion}},"images":[],"videos":[{"id":"{{videoId}}","version":{{videoVersion}}}]}

### Guest listing metadata now includes a videos array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/listings/{{listingId}}

### Guest video bytes; works only if this video is selected in a currently visible listing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/listings/{{listingId}}/videos/{{videoId}}

### Archive privately; use ACTIVE to restore, then review/re-publish the listing
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/videos/{{videoId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{videoVersion}},"status":"ARCHIVED"}

### Seek within an approved public video
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/listings/{{listingId}}/videos/{{videoId}}
Range: bytes=0-999
